laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/free-hand-9914-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5523 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/glitter1-1098-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5524 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/glitter1-1409-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5525 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/smoke-matt-1937-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5526 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/suede-1028-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5527 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/suede-1045-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5528 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/suede-5809-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5529 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/suede-6501-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5530 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/suede-6508-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5531 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/suede-6511-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5532 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/superlative-high-gloss-1085-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5533 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/superlative-high-gloss-1804-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5534 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/superlative-high-gloss-6510-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5535 alignnone size-medium\" /></p>\n<p>Virgo MICA comes with a Mica finish to give a solid and glazy touch to your project. Beautify your space to catch the attention of the onlookers. Add colour and class to spaces that matter.</p>[/et_pb_tab][et_pb_tab title=\"VIRGO DIGITAL\" _builder_version=\"4.19.4\" _module_preset=\"default\" background_color=\"#FFFFFF\" background_enable_color=\"on\" custom_padding=\"10px|10px|10px|10px|true|true\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"]<p><img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Asset-2.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5537 alignnone size-full\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Asset-3.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5538 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Asset-5-1.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5540 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Asset-6.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5541 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Asset-7.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5542 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/Asset-8.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5543 alignnone size-medium\" /> <img src=\"https://virgolam.com/lamina