(5331, 1, '2023-06-06 07:57:06', '2023-06-06 07:57:06', 'The supply chain of Virgo Laminates is extremely active and highly stocked. I got the exact design I was looking for, and the supply was fast. I bought in bulk for my architecture project, and each of the sheets was quality checked and evenly designed, which helped me complete my project with ease.', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5331', '', '', '2023-06-06 11:12:12', '2023-06-06 11:12:12', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5331', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
(5332, 1, '2023-06-06 07:59:16', '2023-06-06 07:59:16', 'I wanted Digital laminates for my architectural project and got exactly what I was looking for in Virgo. Their Digital range of laminates is a treat to the eyes, with exceptional designs and uncompromising quality. Thank You, Virgo!', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5332', '', '', '2023-06-06 11:12:43', '2023-06-06 11:12:43', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5332', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
(5333, 1, '2023-06-06 08:00:59', '2023-06-06 08:00:59', 'I was looking for laminates but didn’t have any particular design in mind. But the huge array of Laminates from Virgo enticed me with their exceptional designs, build, and finishes. I got a design that was loved by my client, and the quality was super-satisfactory. ', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5333', '', '', '2023-06-10 11:57:13', '2023-06-10 11:57:13', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5333', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
(5334, 1, '2023-06-06 08:01:46', '2023-06-06 08:01:46', 'With a large range of designs, build, and finishes to choose from, Virgo Laminates are a class apart when it comes to high-quality home decor. Their laminates are meticulously crafted to suit every taste and have a splendid look and feel. ', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5334', '', '', '2023-06-10 11:51:37', '2023-06-10 11:51:37', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5334', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
(5335, 1, '2023-06-06 08:03:31', '2023-06-06 08:03:31', 'My project needed to start early, and I was looking for suppliers who could supply laminates in bulk and at a super fast speed. I came across Virgo Laminates, which supplied the materials fast and in bulk, which helped me finish my project on time. Thank You, Virgo!', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5335', '', '', '2023-06-06 11:56:47', '2023-06-06 11:56:47', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5335', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
(5336, 1, '2023-06-06 08:03:50', '2023-06-06 08:03:50', 'I sourced my Virgo Laminates from a retail dealer that supplied me with sheets of uniform strength and quality. The sheets were of superb quality and exceptional design that helped me complete my project that satisfied my clients completely. ', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5336', '', '', '2023-06-06 11:14:55', '2023-06-06 11:14:55', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5336', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
(5337, 1, '2023-06-06 08:04:11', '2023-06-06 08:04:11', 'I was looking for top-notch laminates that could satisfy the requirements of my client. As an architect, I had to source high-quality laminates with grabbing looks that could surely be a treat for the eyes. Virgo Laminates provided me with exactly that. Thanks, Virgo.', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5337', '', '', '2023-06-06 11:15:20', '2023-06-06 11:15:20', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5337', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
(5338, 1, '2023-06-06 08:04:24', '2023-06-06 08:04:24', 'Virgo Laminates supplied me with exactly what I was looking for. High-quality sheets with exceptional design and build that satisfied my clients completely. As a builder, I too, was highly satisfied with the prompt delivery service and evenness in the design and quality of every sheet.', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5338', '', '', '2023-06-06 11:15:57', '2023-06-06 11:15:57', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5338', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
(5339, 1, '2023-06-06 08:04:48', '2023-06-06 08:04:48', 'Amazing sheets at the best prices - Virgo Laminates is one brand for all your laminate requirements. As a builder, I was highly satisfied with the quality and design of the laminates, and the best part? They supplied the products fast, within 48 hours. ', '', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5339', '', '', '2023-06-10 12:00:30', '2023-06-10 12:00:30', '', 0, 'https://virgolam.com/laminate-sheets/?post_type=spt_testimonial&#038;p=5339', 0, 'spt_testimonial', '', 0),
